l-current claim." (at 12.7 153.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)) (uuid "85bb01eb-02df-560e-9c88-fad8c4a40bc1")) (text "R602 is fixed BIN insertion bias, NOT an NTC. R606/R607 DNP; actual I2C pullups require MainBoard audit." (at 12.7 160.01999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)) (uuid "119389b3-9006-5a04-a1e9-29f263046e56")) (text "FG_GPOUT is private, NOT PWR_INT. VDD is decoupling only. Charge voltage/temperature remain OPEN." (at 12.7 166.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)) (uuid "c2a65ffd-c68f-56bf-8c6a-6b2a0ee1a12f")) (text "5A pack ceiling: nominal shunt 50mV / 0.25W. No >5A pulse approval, no profile/thermal/hardware qualification." (at 12.7 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)) (uuid "7f305f39-fa0d-5ee6-a82f-1f75aadb18a3")))
